{"_v":1,"id":"bring-it-on-the-musical-2012","cs":70,"rc":12,"bd":{"positive":7,"mixed":4,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Jesse Green","o":"Vulture","s":81,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.vulture.com/2012/08/theater-review-bring-it-on-the-musical.html","d":"2012-08-01","q":"Bring It On certainly gives fierce face, but it also backs up that glittering grill with just enough sinew and substance — musical, physical and textual — to put it in trophy contention as a worthy, weightless delight, a guilty pleasure you needn't feel too guilty about."},{"cn":"Mark Kennedy","o":"Associated Press","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.huffpost.com/huff-wires/20120801/us-theater-review-bring-it-on/","q":"But 'Bring It On: The Musical' has more – more athletics, more songs, more dazzle, more interesting characters."},{"cn":"Steven Suskin","o":"Variety","s":77,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.variety.com/review/VE1117947983","d":"2012-08-02","q":"Strong performances from a personable cast, athletically impressive staging and an engaging score combine to make “Bring It On” a pert and refreshing summer surprise."},{"cn":"Linda Winer","o":"Newsday","s":73,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.newsday.com/entertainment/theater/bring-it-on-review-musical-leaps-high-1.3873686","d":"2012-08-01","q":"This is a harmless entertainment, at least for the audience, cheerfully put together"},{"cn":"Ben Brantley","o":"The New York Times","s":64,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/02/theater/reviews/bring-it-on-the-musical-at-st-james-theater.html","d":"2012-08-01","q":"The show has enough vim and vigor to keep you awake, but not enough wit or wisdom to make you think twice about what you've seen."},{"cn":"Peter Marks","o":"The Washington Post","s":62,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/entertainment/theater_dance/bring-it-on-the-musical-broadway-review/2012/08/01/gJQA8QZKNX_story.html","d":"2012-08-02","q":"The show has infectious energy and skilled performers, but the book by Jeff Whitty never quite manages to transcend the cheerleading movie that inspired it."},{"cn":"Adam Feldman","o":"Time Out New York","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/newyork/theater/bring-it-on-the-musical","d":"2012-08-01","q":"Give yourself over to the spirit of the show, and you'll leave the theater with cheer in your heart."},{"cn":"Joe Dziemianowicz","o":"New York Daily News","s":73,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.nydailynews.com/entertainment/theater-review-bring-musical-article-1.1126661","d":"2012-08-02","q":"\"Bring It On\" doesn't break new ground, but it kept me smiling."},{"cn":"Jeremy Gerard","o":"Bloomberg","s":71,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2012-08-01/olympians-would-tumble-for-teens-of-bring-it-on-review","d":"2012-08-01","q":"\"Bring It On\" is an unself-consciously dopey, feel-good show that provides the audience with eye-candy and an unassailable feel-good message."},{"cn":"Michael Musto","o":"Village Voice","s":63,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://blogs.villagevoice.com/dailymusto/2012/08/bring_it_on_the.php","q":"Teenage girls and their moms will probably enjoy this glorified trifle."},{"cn":"Erik Haagensen","o":"Backstage","s":54,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.backstage.com/bso/reviews-ny-theatre-broadway/ny-review-bring-it-on-the-musical-1007723752.story","d":"2012-08-01","q":"This wisp of cotton candy would probably feel more at home at Madison Square Garden than on the stage of the St. James Theatre."},{"cn":"Eric March","o":"Theater Life","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://theaterlife.com/bring-it-on/","d":"2012-09-17","q":"All fluff, and with an edge of satire, the show is nonetheless lots of fun."}],"au":{"score":77,"designation":"Shrugging","sources":{"mz":{"s":77,"c":80,"sr":3.9},"rd":{"s":40,"c":3,"tp":6,"sent":{"enthusiastic":0,"positive":0,"mixed":0.33,"negative":0.33,"neutral":0.33}}}},"hi":"/images/shows/bring-it-on-the-musical-2012/hero.webp","ta":"246 W 44th St, New York, NY 10036","pd":"2012-07-12","ca":[{"n":"Taylor Louderman","r":"Campbell"},{"n":"Adrienne Warren","r":"Danielle"},{"n":"Ariana DeBose","r":"Nautica"},{"n":"Jason Gotay","r":"Randall"},{"n":"Gregory Haney","r":"La Cienega"},{"n":"Neil Haskell","r":"Steven"},{"n":"Janet Krupin","r":"Kylar"},{"n":"Elle McLemore","r":"Eva"},{"n":"Ryann Redmond","r":"Bridget"},{"n":"Kate Rockwell","r":"Skylar"},{"n":"Nicolas Womack","r":"Twig"},{"n":"Calli Alden","r":"Burger Pagoda Girl"},{"n":"Antwan Bethea","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Dexter Carr","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Michael Naone-Carter","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Courtney Corbeille","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Brooklyn Alexis Freitag","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Shonica Gooden","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Haley Hannah","r":"Burger Pagoda Girl"},{"n":"Joshua Henry","r":"\"Cross the Line\" Soloist"},{"n":"Dominique Johnson","r":"Cameron"},{"n":"Melody Mills","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Michael Mindlin","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"David Ranck","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Bettis Richardson","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Sheldon Tucker","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Alysha Umphress","r":"\"Legendary\" Soloist"},{"n":"Lauren Whitt","r":"Ensemble"}]}